# Cloudflare static-asset redirects, evaluated before anything is served from
# dist/, so a retired URL lands on its replacement rather than the 404 page.
# Both the bare path and the splat are listed: the site builds with
# trailingSlash "always", but an inbound link or an old Google result can
# arrive either way.

# Air conditioning, retired 2026-09-07. Freddy holds no carnet RITE and no
